### ==========================================
### DriveShare Audit Sidecar
### ==========================================

@hostname = localhost
@port = 4000
@host = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}

### ==========================================
### 1. Health Check
### ==========================================

GET {{host}}

###

### ==========================================
### 2. Registrar Evento LOGIN
### ==========================================

POST {{host}}/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_user": 1,
  "email": "maxtin478@gmail.com",
  "action": "LOGIN",
  "http_method": "POST",
  "endpoint": "/api/login",
  "status_code": 200,
  "description": "Inicio de sesión exitoso.",
  "ip_address": "172.18.0.1",
  "user_agent": "REST Client"
}

###

